    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38627" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπεμ-πίπτω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fall upon, attack furiously,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλήλοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.109
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποίμναις ἐπεμπίπτειν βάσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					42
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>fall to, set to work,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pax</u>
				471
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>fit in,</i> of cogs, v. l. in <i><span class="en">
				Heliod.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				49.4.65
			</span></i>.</div>
